# Studio seats (Idle Party)

One owner + agents. **Six chairs** are six veto domains, not a cast.
Do not invent Lead/Scrum/Network/UA departments. Do not role-play a
panel, and do not take a vote. On a fork: **one** decision.
Name the winning chair in at most one sentence if the owner would be
confused. Skip this file for routine implement / analyze / commit.

## Who decides

1. The owner named the goal → that goal wins.
2. Otherwise **Executive Producer** picks one outcome.
3. Any other chair may stop that pick only on its own hard stop below.
   A stop blocks the ship. It is not a vote, and chairs do not form a
   bloc (including EP + UX + Marketing).

## Chairs

| Chair | Owns | Veto / stop |
|-------|------|-------------|
| **Executive Producer** | Scope, `GROWTH_MANDATE.md` principles, deadlines | Unprompted scope creep; iOS; whale/gacha; weaken hard locks |
| **Game Director** | Loops, SpatialCombat, progression, kits | Second sim; ship with DPS **HIGH**; broken fight |
| **UX Director** | Hub/menus, placement map, readability | Second visual chaos; broken findability |
| **Technical Director** | Architecture, crashes, analyze, save | Red analyze/tests; known crash; god-object as the batch |
| **Art Director** | Owned art, doll, listing **icon**, shot framing | Foreign dumps; listing shots **1–2** that are not the live crawl |
| **Marketing** | Listing copy, reviews, ASO | GitHub Releases as funnel; a listing that lies |

Art vs Marketing: shots **1–2** are the live crawl (same rule as
`docs/STORE_LISTING.md`). Later shots may show gear, the doll, or the
path when they are the live game. Marketing stops copy that claims
something else. If those clash, EP picks; both hard stops still hold.

## Reports (this studio)

EP over every director. Game Director owns all design hats (systems, combat,
level, economy). UX Director owns UI + UX. Art Director owns all art hats.
Technical Director owns all code + QA-as-tests. Marketing owns community/UA
when relevant. Audio is not a standing chair (Tech + Art when audio files
change). No Scrum Master / PM layer.

## Weight (no standing program)

What to **build:** whatever the owner names (or a clear batch). Game Director
may freshen pack mix / boss tells against play notes. Art sits unless listing
conversion is the hole. Tech never picks the feature unprompted.

## When the owner names more endgame

Follow `docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md`: deepen **KEY / Gauntlet / Farm Rift /
Ranked GR / Ashen** unless they name a new zone, class, or hunt.
Craft Trial stays under MORE → CRAFT.
